# Lean — efficient development lifecycle (iPix)

**Orchestrator rule (slim).** Hard gates + modes stay here; full phase playbooks load on demand.

| Detail lives in | Role |
|-----------------|------|
| `graphify.mdc` | Query graph before broad source reads |
| `ponytail.mdc` | Smallest change + platform-first ladder |
| `task-naming.mdc` | **IPI-NNN · SPEC — Title** |
| `infisical.mdc` | `infisical run --env=dev --` for secrets |
| `.claude/skills/worktrees/` | Worktree create, health, cleanup |
| `.claude/skills/pr-workflow/` | Verify matrix, PR shape, one concern |
