**Hard gates (never override):** never push to `main`; one concern per PR **and** per commit; build in `app/` not retiring `src/`; remote-only Supabase; no client AI keys.

## Operating modes

Set explicitly (`lean-strict`, `lean-relaxed`) or default to **lean-standard**.

| Mode | When | Worktree | Tests | Plan |
|------|------|----------|-------|------|
| **lean-relaxed** | Typo, copy, single-file fix, docs-only | Skip if clean tree + one file | Focused test or lint only | Mental checklist OK |
| **lean-standard** | Default IPI feature/fix | Required for multi-file / multi-step | Verify matrix rows for touched paths | Short written plan |
| **lean-strict** | Migrations, RLS, auth, payments, Mastra/agents, Cloudflare deploy | Always | Full matrix + build when applicable + manual probes | Plan + rollback notes |

## Decision ladder (reuse → create)

Apply **after** graphify discovery and **during** implementation (full ladder in `ponytail.mdc`):

```text
1. YAGNI → 2. Exists in repo? → 3. Extend safely?
4. Platform (Dashboard/CLI) → 5. Stdlib / native → 6. Installed dep
7. Only then: minimum new code
```

| Decision | Choose when | Avoid when |
|----------|-------------|------------|
| **Reuse / extend** | Same behavior, clear owner | Hidden coupling / wrong layer |
| **Worktree** | Multi-step or dirty main tree | One-line fix on clean branch |
| **Focused tests** | Every commit during implementation | Full suite on every save |
| **Full suite / build** | Routes, env, middleware, pre-PR | Docs-only change |
| **Open PR** | Branch pushed, matrix green | Mixed concerns still in diff |

## Lifecycle (load skills for steps)

```text
Understand → Discover (graphify) → Plan → Isolate (worktree)
  → Implement (ponytail) → Test (verify-matrix) → Diff → Commit
  → PR → CI → Merge → Cleanup worktree
```

- **Specs / AC:** `.claude/skills/ipix-task-lifecycle/`
- **Commands:** `cd app && npm run typecheck && npm run lint && npm test` (+ `build` when routes/config/env/middleware change)
- **Supabase:** `infisical run --env=dev -- npm run supabase:verify` (+ `-rls` / `-edge` as needed)
- **PR body:** `pr-description.mdc` · evidence levels: `task-accuracy.mdc`

## Checklist (lean-standard+)

```text
[ ] Issue + AC  [ ] Graphify  [ ] Plan  [ ] Worktree healthy
[ ] Smallest safe change  [ ] Verify matrix green  [ ] One concern
[ ] Commit → PR  [ ] CI green  [ ] Merge → remove worktree
```

